<concept id="t00548">
	<title>Warning and control</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>Intelligent Speed Limit Assist has the following warnings and controls:</p>
		<ul id="e03539">
			<li>
				<p>Displaying the speed limit</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Speeding warning</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Manual set speed change</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Auto set speed change</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>Speed Limit Menu Setting Status</p>
		<ul id="e03540">
			<li>
				<p><b>When the navigation system is applied</b>: Auto Assist, Manual Assist, Warning</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p><b>When the navigation system is not applied</b>: Speed Limit Assist, Speed Limit Warning</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="tip" id="e03541">
			<p>Intelligent Speed Limit Assist warnings and controls operate based on adjusting the Offset to “0”.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
